# Your own changes to the plugins dsh-mm loads, applied after overlay.yml.
# Setup creates this file only when it is missing and never overwrites it, so your changes survive updates.
# 你自己对 dsh-mm 插件的修改，在 overlay.yml 之后生效。
# 安装脚本只在这个文件不存在时创建它，以后更新不会覆盖，你的修改会一直保留。
#
# Turn a plugin off: add its id with disabled: true, then restart dsh-mm. Delete the two lines to turn it on again.
# 关闭某个插件：写上它的 id 和 disabled: true，然后重启 dsh-mm。删掉这两行即可重新启用。
#
# - id: memory
#   disabled: true
#
# Plugin ids / 插件 id:
#   tool-read-document             read PDF and Office files / 读 PDF 和 Office 文件
#   vision-bridge                  ask_image for text-only models / 让纯文本模型看图
#   tool-read-audio                listen to recordings / 听录音
#   tool-read-video                watch videos / 看视频
#   speech-to-text, speech-to-text-sensevoice   speech recognition used by the two above / 上面两个用的语音识别
#   memory                         long-term memory / 长期记忆
#   agent-bridge, ui-agent-bridge  Claude Code, Codex and Gemini CLI sessions and memory / Agent 互通
#   co-canvas, ui-co-canvas        co-canvas: live view, marks, questions, timeline / 协同画布
#   computer-use, computer-use-cua-driver-native   computer use / 电脑操作
[]
